{"title":"Icosidigon","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>An <b>icosidigon</b> is a polygon with 22 sides. The sum of its interior angle measures is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/d/2fd3105d0cb4f953e98587af2f3dbda3616b80d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3600^{\\circ}$\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Icosidigon&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Polygon\" title=\"Polygon\">Polygon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Geometry\" title=\"Geometry\">Geometry</a></li></ul>\n<p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Icosidigon&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018090845\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.013 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 14/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 271/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 154/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.635      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    5.635      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:9259:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018090845 and revision id 38154. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}